+ * set_render_scale: internal resolution, num/den times the guest's (1/1 is
+ * native, 3/2 turns 720p into 1080p; at most 8). Colour and depth targets are
+ * remade at once, keeping colour contents; what is read back into guest
+ * memory is scaled down to guest pixels again, and frame dumps stay at the
